    id: "blog-priv-w46",
    slug: "priv-week-46",
    title: "Global Supply Chain Bottlenecks: How Transaction Ledgers Predict Material Shortages Before Customs Declarations",
    subtitle: "The financial data layer is becoming the most reliable early-warning system for supply chain disruption — and most organizations are ignoring it.",
    author: 'Sans Mercantile Editorial Team',
