    featuredImageDescription: "Editorial hero image for The Priv Manifesto: Why Zero-Friction Transactions and Institutional-Grade Analysis Are Non-Negotiable",
    keywords: ["Priv Manifesto", "zero-friction transactions", "institutional analysis", "transaction flow optimization", "enterprise financial technology", "institutional-grade analytics"],
