    slug: "omega-week-14",
    title: "The Death of Trial-and-Error Chemistry: How Virtual Molecular Simulation Is Replacing the Wet Lab",
    subtitle: "Omega's virtual test-tube approach lets research teams simulate molecular combinations computationally, compressing discovery timelines and eliminating the waste inherent in traditional bench chemistry.",
