    featuredImageDescription: "Editorial hero image for Ethical Protocols in Automated Discovery: The Moral Imperative of Open-Access Therapeutic Templates",
    keywords: ["ethical protocols", "automated discovery", "open-access therapeutic templates", "health equity", "governance", "life sciences strategy"],
